OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife                
OL,5,CToday:FA frosty start for most then it 
OL,6,Fwill be a dry and bright day with some 
OL,7,Flong sunny spells. Mostly lights       
OL,8,Finland, a moderate southeasterly along 
OL,9,Fthe east coast.                        
OL,11,CTonight:FA dry evening, some clear     
OL,12,Fspells, frost returning for a time to  
OL,13,Fmany inland areas, but temperatures    
OL,14,Flifting overnight as winds pick up and 
OL,15,Fpatchy rain reaches the west.          
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
