OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife                
OL,5,CTuesday:FDry start in east otherwise   
OL,6,Fcloudy with outbreaks of rain turning  
OL,7,Fheavier with some snow across the      
OL,8,Fhills of Perthshire and the Trossachs, 
OL,9,Fperhaps affecting higher level routes  
OL,10,Flater. Windy.                          
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FCloudy
OL,13,Fwith further rain and hill snow on     
OL,14,FWednesday gradually easing. Mainly dry 
OL,15,Fand bright on Thursday. Dry start      
OL,16,FFriday then rain arriving from the west
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
